sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor W as Wholesaler
    participant P as Qawafel platform
    actor A as Qawafel analyst
    participant G as Bank gateway
    participant B as Bank partner

    W->>P: Create application, requested amount
    W->>P: Upload invoices (Excel) + bank statements (PDF)
    P->>P: Store originals (hash, encrypted)<br/>Parse in background, validate
    P-->>W: Data issues: excluded / flagged / missing months
    opt Blocking problems
        W->>P: Upload corrected file
    end
    W->>P: Consent for the named bank + submit
    P->>P: Match paid invoices to deposits<br/>Analyse, save immutable snapshot
    P-->>A: Application ready for review
    A->>P: Review issues, flags, score, limit
    alt Need more information
        A->>P: Information request
        P-->>W: What is needed
        W->>P: Answer / new files (back to step 3)
    else Decline
        A->>P: Decision: decline + reason
        P-->>W: Notified
    else Recommend
        A->>P: Decision: recommend (with conditions)
        P->>G: Package = snapshot + original files
        G->>B: Send (idempotency key, retries)
        B-->>G: Received, bank reference
        G->>B: Confirm by reading the status back
        P-->>W: Sent to bank
        B->>B: Credit review
        B-->>G: Outcome (webhook or polling)
        G->>B: Re-read status to verify (see Task 4)
        G->>P: Verified outcome
        P-->>A: Outcome
        P-->>W: Approved / declined / more info needed
    end
